Fresh water Identi ˱cation measures are as follows:

• Group sites using freshwater located in areas of high or extreme water stress are identi ˱ed and reviewed annually.

Actions include:

• implementing water action plans to reduce impact on the resource, while considering the watershed context and local stakeholders. These actions are integrated into environmental action plans;

• identifying and carrying out actions to reduce freshwater consumption at existing sites;

