Identi ˱cation measures are as follows:

Biodiversity and ecosystems

• for each Group activity, identifying material negative impacts related to land degradation, deserti ˱cation or soil sealing, see Section 3.1.2.2.4 Biodiversity and ecosystems;

• establishing a list of material priority sites, categorized by identi ˱ed impacts, dependencies and sensitive areas impacted. These sites are assessed based on ˱ve levels of criticality, see Section 3.1.2.2.4 Biodiversity and ecosystems;

