Resource use and circular economy

• Waste management is carried out in accordance with the order of eight actions de ˱ned in the policy: eco-design, preservation, optimization, reuse, repair, recycling, innovation, empowerment. As with other environmental matters, risk mitigation actions are included in environmental action plans.

Actions include:

• continuing to implement the Material Risks Passport;

• promoting the circular economy and natural resources dimension in LCAs (resource optimization, waste reduction, carbon footprint reduction, value chain improvement, regulatory and societal expectations);

• developing energy recovery from industrial and tertiary processes, using local resources.

